# Source art and audio ARE tracked (phase 0 decision, no LFS): CI has to be
# able to re-embed a sound, regenerate an icon and shoot store screenshots.
# That now includes assets/image/master/, the painted masters — ~175 MB / 405
# files in total, of which 121 MB is assets/image/master/ alone. They ship
# nowhere: the build embeds assets/image/embed/, their 3.2 MB WebP cut, and the
# masters are what tools/lab/encode-art.mjs needs to re-cut it. See
# docs/INDUSTRIALIZATION.md.

.DS_Store
.vscode/
dist/
native/

# The studio signing secrets and the keystore itself: one file outside this
# repo names them (see tools/publish/gen-native.mjs). Never committed.
signing.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
